msgctxt "(Customizer) Newsfeed Option - Limit YouTube Playback - Description"
msgid ""
"You can choose to limit YouTube embedded video playbacks on the newsfeed of "
"the site. If you select \"Yes\", only one YouTube video will be played at a "
"time, this means that, if a user is playing a video and chooses to play "
"another one, then the previous video will be paused. The %sYouTube Player API"
"%s is used to achieve this behaviour."
