#: views/changelog.php:1672
msgid ""
"With this update, users can now edit all subgroup names from the backend "
"\"Users\" -> \"Profile Fields\" page to translate them and then enter that "
"same name on the respective customizer \"Vikinger Settings\" -> \"xProfile "
"Groups / Fields\" option."
