#: views/changelog.php:1712 views/troubleshooting.php:343
msgid ""
"Any xProfile field names can be changed to translate them without further "
"changes, except the \"Profile_Bio\" \"About\" field whose new name has to be "
"entered in the respective customizer \"Vikinger Settings\" -> \"xProfile "
"Groups / Fields\" option."
