msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1796
msgid "Theme Setup Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1800
msgid ""
"The theme plugin installer now allows for customized or preset installs. "
"This allows users to keep their plugins up to date by using the theme "
"installer even if they don't want to use a particular plugin, avoiding to "
"have a plugin forcefully installed and having to uninstall it when updating "
"core theme plugins."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1804
msgid ""
"Custom preset allows you to manually select which plugins you want to "
"install and saves your configuration, while other presets feature "
"preconfigured plugin combinations that automatically select the required "
"plugins for each particular preset."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1808
msgid ""
"The last selected preset is saved and used by default when opening the setup "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1812
msgid "The following presets are now available:"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1828
msgid "Community"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1836
msgid "Community + Gamification"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1844
msgid "Community + Forum"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1852
msgid "Community + Gamification + Forum"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1860
msgid "Added the following plugins to the theme installer:"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1868
msgid "Verified Member for BuddyPress"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1876
msgid "BP Better Messages"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1884
msgid "GamiPress - bbPress Integration"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1892
msgid ""
"The theme plugin installer doesn't uninstall or deactivate any plugins, so "
"if you want to change from a preset that has more plugins to one that has "
"fewer, you will need to manually deactivate or uninstall any plugins that "
"you don't want to use."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1896
msgid "Child Theme Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1900
msgid ""
"Added the \"languages/\" directory and enabled the loading of the child "
"theme translation files on its \"functions.php\" file. You can now put your "
"translation files on the child theme \"languages/\" directory, without "
"having to make any changes to the \"functions.php\" file, and they will be "
"loaded before the parent theme ones (you need to be using the child theme "
"for this to work, this means you need to have it installed and active in "
"your WordPress backend -> \"Appearance\" menu)."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1904
msgid ""
"Most parent theme functions can now be overriten in the child theme (i.e. "
"including a function with the same name on the child theme \"functions.php\" "
"file, either directly or by using the same file structure as the parent, we "
"recommend this second approach), allowing for easier customization of the "
"parent theme functionality on the child theme. To make sure if you can "
"override a parent theme function, please check if it has the "
"function_exists() condition before its declaration."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1948
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that would ocurr on the profile info settings screen if a "
"datebox profile field didn't have an absolute or relative range type set."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:1996
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that allowed the user to submit an activity with no text or "
"media if the user clicked on the \"Add Photo\" button but didn't yet add any "
"photos."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2012
msgid "Added support for relative ranges in \"Date Selector\" profile fields."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2020
msgid "Videos Uploader"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2024
msgid "Users can now upload videos and post them on activity status updates."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2028
msgid ""
"A new \"Videos\" page has been added to the members and groups profile pages "
"to display the videos that the user has uploaded to his profile and group "
"members have uploaded to the group. From the \"Videos\" page, users can "
"upload and delete videos that they have uploaded through status updates or "
"direct upload through this page."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2032
msgid ""
"A new customizer section named \"Media\" has been added (\"Customizer\" -> "
"\"Vikinger Settings\" -> \"Media\") that allow users to change media (photo "
"and video) related settings."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2036
msgid ""
"The following \"Photo\" related options had been added to this new "
"customizer section."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2044
msgid ""
"Photo Upload - Maximum Size in MB: with this option, you can set the maximum "
"size allowed for photos that users upload to the server. If a photo the user "
"tries to upload has a size that is bigger than the one you choose here, then "
"the user will be notified of this and he won't be able to upload it. You "
"can't set this size to be higher than your server maximum upload file size."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2052
msgid ""
"Photo Upload - Allowed Extensions: with this option, you can set the file "
"extensions allowed when a user uploads a photo. If a photo the user tries to "
"upload has an extension that is not allowed, then the user will be notified "
"of this and he won't be able to upload it."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2060
msgid ""
"The following \"Video\" related options had been added to this new "
"customizer section."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2068
msgid ""
"Video Upload - Maximum Size in MB: with this option, you can set the maximum "
"size allowed for videos that users upload to the server. If a video the user "
"tries to upload has a size that is bigger than the one you choose here, then "
"the user will be notified of this and he won't be able to upload it. You "
"can't set this size to be higher than your server maximum upload file size."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2076
msgid ""
"Video Upload - Allowed Extensions: with this option, you can set the file "
"extensions allowed when a user uploads a video. If a video the user tries to "
"upload has an extension that is not allowed, then the user will be notified "
"of this and he won't be able to upload it."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2092
msgid ""
"When deleting an activity, all photos and videos associated to it are now "
"deleted."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2100
msgid ""
"When deleting photos or videos from user/groups photos or videos pages, the "
"associated activity will be deleted if all videos/photos included in that "
"activity where deleted. For example: a user creates a status update on his "
"profile with 2 photos, if he deletes those 2 photos from the user photos "
"page, then the status update will also be deleted. If the user only deletes "
"1 of the 2 photos, then the status update will remain and only show the "
"photo that wasn't deleted."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2108
msgid ""
"Added two new filters in activity feeds: Photos and Videos. The Media filter "
"is still available and can be used to show both Photos and Videos types of "
"activities."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2116
msgid ""
"Activity status updates now detail if they belong to a photo or video update "
"instead of the previous generic \"posted an update\"."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2164
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused selected grid type by logged out users to try to "
"be saved."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2172
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused a white space to display before media in "
"activities that had no text."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2180
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that prevented the Elementor landing template from loading."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2228
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused duplicated user and group information to display "
"on group forum topics and replies activities."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2244
msgid ""
"Selected grid types for blog post, member and group lists are now saved for "
"logged users. This means that the next time they browse to a page with the "
"same type of list (member, group or post), the last grid type that the user "
"selected will be automatically used for the list display."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2252
msgid "Search Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2256
msgid ""
"We introduced a new section called \"Search\" (in \"Customizer\" -> "
"\"Vikinger Settings\") to allow search related customization."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2260
msgid ""
"Users can now choose to hide the header search input by using the "
"\"Display / Hide\" option."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2264
msgid ""
"We also added options that allow the user to select which components are "
"included in search results, both on the search main page as well as the "
"header search dropdown."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2268
msgid "The available options are:"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2276
msgid "Show blog posts in search"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2284
msgid "Show members in search"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2292
msgid "Show groups in search"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2300
msgid ""
"Any combination of blog posts, members and groups can be selected to be "
"included in search results (i.e. only blog posts, blog posts and members, "
"members and groups, etc)."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2304
msgid "User Avatar Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2308
msgid ""
"We introduced a new section called \"Avatar\" (in \"Customizer\" -> "
"\"Vikinger Settings\") to allow avatar related customization."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2312
msgid ""
"The new \"Avatar Type\" option can be found here from where you can select "
"the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2344
msgid ""
"The type selected will be used for the display of all avatars throughout the "
"site. "
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2348
msgid ""
"Also, user avatars no longer show rank related progress bar and badges when "
"the GamiPress plugin is not installed and active."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2392
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused the forum description notice to try to get the "
"last author information even when the forum had no content."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2400
msgid ""
"Fixed post comment list showing a loading indicator even when the post had 0 "
"comments."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2408
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that could cause the comment list to wrongly report that more "
"comments where available to show after creating a new comment."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2416
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused the reply button to show on comments when the "
"\"Allow Comments\" option was disabled."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2424
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused the light/dark mode toggle to not refresh the "
"page under certain conditions."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2432
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused duplicated characters to appear on some inputs "
"when using certain languages."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2448
msgid ""
"Added a different background color to forum and topic even rows to improve "
"visual separation between them."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2456
msgid ""
"Pages with \"Allow Comments\" option disabled now hide all comment related "
"elements instead of only disabling the comment form."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2464
msgid "bbPress Group Forums"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2468
msgid ""
"Users can now create a forum for their group by using the frontend \"Manage "
"Groups\" settings screen."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2472
msgid ""
"If the bbPress settings option \"Allow BuddyPress Groups to have their own "
"forums\" is active, then a new \"Forum\" tab will be added to the group "
"manage popup for group admins. You can also select a forum or category to be "
"used to contain all group forums from this settings screen by using the "
"bbPress \"Primary Forum\" option."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2476
msgid ""
"From the group manage popup \"Forum\" tab, the \"Enable forum for this group"
"\" option can be activated to create a forum for the group which will be "
"available both on the forum page and as a new link on the group page "
"navigation bar."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2480
msgid ""
"The group name, description and status will be used by default for the group "
"forum, however users can choose to change the title, description and status "
"of the forum (the group avatar image will be used as the forum image)."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2484
msgid ""
"After enabling forum for the group, group admins can delete the forum and "
"all its content just by disabling the same option (\"Enable forum for this "
"group\") and by clicking on \"Save Changes\"."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2528
msgid "Fixed comment timestamp displaying with an offset for logged out users."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2536
msgid ""
"Fixed some cases where the side menu item for the current page wouldn't be "
"marked as active."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2552
msgid "Improved visibility of the activity and comment settings dropdown icon."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2560 views/demo-import.php:25 views/demo-import.php:54
#: views/index.php:409
msgid "Demo Import"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2564
msgid ""
"We created a demo content import tool to allow users to easily replicate the "
"content from the demo into their theme. This tool can be used any number of "
"times and also includes the ability to reset (delete) the imported data. If "
"you want to remove data created by the importer, please use this option."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2568
msgid ""
"The importer can be used from the new backend theme \"Demo Import\" menu. "
"Users are not forced to import all demo content data and can select what "
"they want to import."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2577
#, php-format
msgid ""
"We created a new %stutorial video%s which includes the full theme install "
"and setup process, including the use of this new demo import tool. We also "
"updated the theme documentation to include a new \"Demo Import\" section."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2629
msgid ""
"The \"Add New\" button of the Groups backend menu now correctly sends the "
"user to their \"Manage Groups\" settings screen."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2637
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that would occur when a duplicate comment was created on a "
"blog post."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2653
msgid ""
"The \"Light\" and \"Dark\" Color Switch now clears user meta cache to force "
"getting and displaying the user selected theme when switching."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2661
msgid ""
"The \"Account Settings\" section has been added to the users Account menu. "
"From here, users can use the \"Delete Account\" button to delete their "
"account from the site. Site admins can choose to enable or disable allowing "
"registered members to delete their own accounts by using the BuddyPress "
"backend settings option: \"Settings\" -> \"BuddyPress\" -> \"Options\" -> "
"\"Account Deletion\"."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2669
msgid ""
"Updated the \"YapEX - BuddyPress Extension\" plugin to include the new "
"delete account related \"Account Settings\" menu. Please update the plugin "
"using the theme installer."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2677
msgid "Introduced newsfeed related performance optimizations."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2689
msgid ""
"Users can now delete their activity and blog comments. A new actions "
"dropdown has been added next to the \"Reply\" button with the option "
"\"Delete Comment\" to comments owned by the logged in user."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2693
msgid ""
"A new grayscale fade visual effect has been added on activity and comment "
"deletion confirmation that indicates that the activity or comments are being "
"deleted."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2697
msgid "Activity Feed Settings"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2701
msgid ""
"Several new options have been added to the \"Customizer\" -> \"Vikinger "
"Settings\" -> \"Newsfeed\" section which allow users more control over "
"activity feed related settings."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2709
msgid ""
"Activity - Show More Status: by enabling this option, a \"Show More\" button "
"will appear on activities that have a large height."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2717
msgid ""
"Activity - Show More Height: you can control the maximum height that the "
"feed activities can have. If an activity has a height that is greater than "
"this value, then the remaining content will be hidden and a \"Show More\" "
"button will be created to allow users to display the remaining activity "
"content."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2725
msgid ""
"Activity - Character Limit: you can control the maximum number of characters "
"that users can put into an activity."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2733
msgid ""
"Activity - Comment Character Limit: you can control the maximum number of "
"characters that users can put into an activity comment (this limit also "
"applies for blog post comments)."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2741
msgid "Members Settings"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2745
msgid ""
"Several new options have been added to the \"Customizer\" -> \"Vikinger "
"Settings\" -> \"Members\" section which allow users more control over "
"members related settings."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2749
msgid ""
"From this section, you can now enable or disable member profile pages added "
"by the theme. This will allow you to easily disable a member profile page "
"and associated navigation item if you don't want to use it (like the profile "
"blog page)."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2753
msgid ""
"You can also choose the order in which enabled pages are displayed in the "
"profile navigation bar (lower numbered pages will display before higher "
"numbered ones), allowing you to display the pages you think are more "
"important or should be easier to access first in the navigation bar."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2757
msgid "BP Better Messages Integration"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2761
msgid ""
"Modified the BP Better Messages plugin elements styles so that they use "
"theme preset colors and made several adjustments to each element to make its "
"styles integrate better with the theme."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2805
msgid ""
"Fixed the membership requests settings screen page title using the received "
"invitations screen title."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2813
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue which would prevent received membership requests from being "
"displayed on the user \"Membership Requests\" settings page."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2821
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that would cause some BuddyPress Private Messaging module "
"related features to show when the \"Private Messaging\" module was "
"deactivated on the BuddyPress Settings Page."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2829
msgid ""
"Dates in the user profile about widgets are now displayed localized and with "
"the format selected on the WordPress backend \"Settings\" -> \"General\" -> "
"\"Date Format\" setting."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2850
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Added a new Customizer option that allows limiting YouTube embed video "
"playbacks on the newsfeed. The option can be found on \"Vikinger Settings\" -"
"> \"Newsfeed\" -> \"Limit YouTube Playback\". You can use this option to "
"limit YouTube embedded video playbacks on the newsfeed of the site. If you "
"select \"Yes\", only one YouTube video will be played at a time, this means "
"that, if a user is playing a video and chooses to play another one, then the "
"previous video will be paused. The %sYouTube Player API%s is used to achieve "
"this behaviour."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2866
msgid "Introduced several performance improvements and optimizations."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2914
msgid ""
"Fixed the header showing the cogwheel dropdown on lower resolutions when the "
"same information was available on the mobile menu."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2922
msgid ""
"Fixed the username (mention name) of the post author (in post version 3) "
"being centered instead of aligned to the left."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2930
msgid ""
"Fixed the \"locked\" and \"unlocked!\" achievement progress bar text not "
"being translatable."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2938
msgid ""
"Fixed \"Archive\" pages showing the page headers when the option to hide "
"them was selected on the Customizer."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2954
msgid ""
"Replaced \"Messages\" string with \"Inbox\" on the header messages dropdown "
"to avoid confusion regarding the previewed content."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2962
msgid "Color Theme Switch"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2966
msgid ""
"You can now choose to enable a color theme switch via the \"Customizer\" -> "
"\"Vikinger Settings\" -> \"Color Presets\" menu."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2970
msgid ""
"If enabled, your site logged in users will be able to change between a "
"\"Light\" and \"Dark\" theme while browsing the site by using a sun / moon "
"button that is added on the header on desktop and on the header menu on "
"mobile."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2974
msgid ""
"From the same Customizer section you can set which of the existing color "
"presets you want to assign when the \"Light\" or \"Dark\" theme modes are "
"activated. For example, you can choose to use the \"Custom\" color preset "
"for the \"Light\" theme mode, and the \"Carbon Yellow\" color preset for the "
"\"Dark\" theme mode."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2978
msgid ""
"You can also set the default theme mode (\"Light\" or \"Dark\") that is used "
"when the color theme switch is active."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2982
msgid ""
"When the color theme switch is disabled, the theme will use the color preset "
"that you assign in the \"Color Preset\" option."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2986
msgid "BP Better Messages Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2990
msgid "The theme is now compatible with the BP Better Messages plugin."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2994
msgid ""
"This means that, when the plugin is installed and active, it will replace "
"the Messages profile setting screen with the one provided by the plugin. "
"Also, when clicking on a message from the header messages dropdown, it will "
"correctly open and display that message on the settings screen."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:2998
msgid "Verified Member for BuddyPress Integration"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3002
msgid "Added support for the \"Verified Member for BuddyPress\" plugin."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3006
msgid ""
"All member related widgets now support the display of the \"verified\" badge "
"next to the user fullname or username (mention name) according to the "
"setting the user has selected on the plugin (\"Settings\" -> \"BuddyPress\" -"
"> \"Verified Member\")."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3050
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that would cause group slugs to display incorrect characters "
"when using certain languages."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3058
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that could cause the group manage popup to infinite load "
"after submitting the creation of a new group."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3066
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused the activity feed to stop working when an "
"activity or post that was shared was deleted and added a message which "
"informs the user that the shared content was deleted."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3074
msgid ""
"Fixed group status dropdown text not being translated correctly in the group "
"management popup."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3082
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused the notifications bar to stop working when a user "
"had a message from a deleted user in their inbox."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3098
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Profile Fields that are empty will no longer display in the "
"About, Personal Information and Personal Interests widgets, when they would "
"previously display with a \"-\" as value."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3106
msgid ""
"The slug option has been removed from the group creation and manage screens "
"based on user feedback."
msgstr ""

