msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3166
msgid ""
"We've updated the \"FAQs\" section with answers to the most frequently asked "
"questions our support team has been receiving and we also updated the "
"\"Support\" section with a more detailed explanation of what the theme "
"Support includes according to Envato's Support Policy as well as third party "
"sources that offer Customization Services for users that want to customize "
"their theme."
msgstr ""

