#: views/changelog.php:3354
msgid "Private Groups"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3358
msgid ""
"Added support for BuddyPress private groups. Users can now create private "
"groups which content can only be seen by members of the group."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3362
msgid ""
"Private groups have a \"Request Membership\" button instead of the \"Join "
"Group\" button that the public groups have. To join a private group, a user "
"has to send a membership request and needs the approval of a member of that "
"group. The membership request can also be canceled by the initiating user or "
"rejected by any member of the private group."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3366
msgid ""
"Both membership requests and rejections now feature a specific notification "
"message which links to the new group membership requests settings page. This "
"new page allows to manage membership requests sent to a group and received "
"by any private group the user is a member of."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3370
msgid ""
"Existing public groups can be converted to private groups by editing them "
"from the \"Manage Groups\" settings page, the group manage popup will now "
"have the option to select group status via a dropdown."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3374
msgid "Activity Feed Improvements"
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3378
msgid ""
"We introduced several improvements related to the activity feed, including "
"activity preloading and removing the need for the feed to reload when adding "
"a new post."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3382
msgid ""
"The new activity preloading allows for activities to load faster after the "
"initial load, activities are loaded in the background while browsing and "
"displayed when the user scrolls to view more."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3386
msgid ""
"Removing activity list reload when updating the feed to show new posts "
"allows for activity shares to be displayed dynamically when previously a "
"page reload was needed as to not break the flow when the user scrolled and "
"wanted to share something but continue browsing afterwards without having "
"the feed reload. Regular activity posts also benefit from this new "
"behaviour, they will display dynamically and faster after submitting them."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3390
msgid ""
"We also introduced some improvements to the Pin activity functionality, "
"pinned activities are now visible to all users instead of only to the user "
"that made the pin, this allows for the pin functionality to not only be used "
"personally but to highlight a post in a user profile for others to see. "
"Also, users can now only pin an activity in their profile feed page, "
"removing the option incorrectly showing on the main activity feed and other "
"profile activity feeds."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3434
msgid ""
"Fixed the \"No badges unlocked text\" incorrectly showing on the Elementor "
"login register widget when the GamiPress plugin was not active."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3442
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused text to not wrap correctly on some element boxes."
msgstr ""

#: views/changelog.php:3450
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused users to show in the ranks page when their "
